  "descriptions": {
    "en": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "Ark (the archaeological recording kit) 2.0 development repository. Ark (the archaeological recording kit) is a web-based 'toolkit' for the collection, storage and dissemination of archaeological data. It includes data-editing, data-creation, data-viewing and data-sharing tools, all of which are delivered using a web-based front-end."
    }
